==German==

===Etymology===
''Kakao'' is in this case perhaps a euphemism for ''[[Kacke]]'' (Duden Herkunftswörterbuch 3rd ed.)

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|De-durch den Kakao ziehen.ogg|Audio|lang=de}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb}}

# {{lb|de|idiomatic}} to [[pull someone's leg]], to [[make fun of]] somebody or something, to [[roast]] someone.
#: {{ux|de|Er '''zieht''' dich nur '''durch den Kakao'''.|t=He is just pulling your leg.|inline=1}}

====Conjugation====
{{de-conj-strong|zieh|zog|gezogen|h|||zög|a||durch den Kakao}}

